  "question": {
    "text": "A word has <math><mn>4</mn></math> identical letters and rest all are distinct letters. If the total number of words that can be made with the letters of the word be <math><mn>210,</mn></math> then the total number of different letters in the word is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>3</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>5</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>7</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let the number of distinct letters other than the identical letters be <math><mi>n</mi></math>.<br />Total letters <math><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br />Identical <math><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math> Distinct <math><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi></math><br />Number of ways in which they can be arranged <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>210</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>…</mo><mn>6.5</mn></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>210</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br />So, the required number of total different letters <math><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>"
  }
}